{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 127 days before the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Cisplatin has been on FDA's shortage list since 2023-02-10 and as of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 44 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1207607 at Thymoorgan Pharmazie Gmbh ended 2022-10-06 and was classified VAI, 127 days before FDA posted the shortage on 2023-02-10.",
      "cites": ["D5", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A later FDA inspection 1203954 at the same plant ended 2023-04-25 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2023-07-10, 74 days after the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc. (NDC 00143950401) names THYMOORGAN GMBH PHARMAZIE as a registered plant for manufacture, analysis, labeling, and packing, last inspected VAI 2023-04-25.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 50 vials of cisplatin 50 mg/50 mL at 3.1 vials per day (16.1 days on hand) and 116 vials of cisplatin 1 mg/mL at 6.2 vials per day (18.7 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 94 vials of cisplatin 50 mg/50 mL at 3 vials per day (30.9 days on hand) and 176 vials of cisplatin 1 mg/mL at 5.7 vials per day (31 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D2", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best option by rule is to buy from Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose plant was last inspected VAI 2023-08-24.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    }
  ]
}
